failure leaves an explanation in [[error]] and everything released.

<<Start the CloudXR service>>=
bool CloudXrService::start(const std::string& sdkDir, const std::string& deviceProfile, std::string& error)
{
    <<Find and load the CloudXR library>>
    <<Resolve the entry points of the CloudXR service>>

    <<Create the CloudXR service and choose its device profile>>
    <<Start the CloudXR service, keeping our signal handlers>>
    <<Report a failed CloudXR start, or point OpenXR at the runtime>>
